sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Customer
  participant W as Claims blueprint
  participant G as RBAC guards
  participant D as Document service
  participant P as Pipeline
  participant R as Rule engine
  participant M as Python model
  participant T as Teachable Machine
  participant Q as Decision table
  participant DB as Database
  U->>W: POST /claims/new (form + files)
  W->>G: require("claim.create"), authorize_object(product)
  G-->>W: allowed (own product)
  W->>D: validate magic bytes, store, SHA-256, OCR
  D-->>W: documents + confirmed values
  W->>P: evaluate_claim(claim)
  P->>P: contradictions, duplicates, feature record
  P->>R: evaluate(facts)
  R-->>P: hard fails / review rules / warnings
  P->>M: predict_proba(record)
  M-->>P: class + 3 confidences + version
  P->>P: render Claim Summary Card (no prediction on it)
  P->>T: predict(card)
  T-->>P: class + 3 confidences + version (or unavailable)
  P->>Q: decide(counts, consistency, classes)
  Q-->>P: decision, rule id, trace
  P->>DB: ModelEvaluation + RuleValidationLog (immutable)
  W->>DB: status history, notifications, audit rows
  W-->>U: redirect to claim page with explanation
